window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch075","pages":[{"n":552,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b541\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第75 章ranges 属性实验<\/h2>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b542\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">75.1 platform_get_resource 获取设备树资源<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">由于设备树在系统启动的时候都会转化为platform 设备，那我们能不能直接在驱动中使用platform_get_resource()函数直接获取platform_device 资源呢？<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b543\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">75.1.1 驱动程序编写<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">带着疑惑我们这里仍旧以72 章的驱动程序为原型，在probe() 函数中加入使用platform_get_resource()函数获取reg 资源，添加完成的驱动程序内容如代码清单75.1 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.1<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"28\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/module.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/platform_device.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/mod_devicetable.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 平台设备的初始化函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct resource *myresources;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int my_platform_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    printk(KERN_INFO &quot;my_platform_probe: Probing platform device\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 获取平台设备的资源<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    myresources = platform_get_resource(pdev, IORESOURCE_MEM, 0);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (myresources == NULL) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果获取资源失败，打印value_compatible 的值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printk(&quot;platform_get_resource is error\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    printk(&quot;reg valus is %llx\\n&quot; , myresources-&gt;start);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 平台设备的移除函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int my_platform_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    printk(KERN_INFO &quot;my_platform_remove: Removing platform device\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 清理设备特定的操作<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // ...<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 552 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"552\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":553,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大第 553 页表格\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0553-table0.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"原书第 553 页复杂表格，点击放大\"><\/button><figcaption>原书表格 · 第 553 页 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>"},{"n":554,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"77\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">module_init(my_platform_driver_init);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">module_exit(my_platform_driver_exit);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">MODULE_LICENSE(&quot;GPL&quot;); MODULE_AUTHOR(&quot;topeet&quot;);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 554 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"554\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">编译成模块之后，放到开发板上进行加载，打印信息如图75.1 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图75.1\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0554-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图75.1\" width=\"974\" height=\"83\"><\/button><figcaption>图75.1 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">可以看到使用platform_get_resource()函数获取reg 资源实验失败了，在下一个小节中将分析获取资源失败的原因。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b544\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">75.1.2 获取资源失败源码分析<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">platform_get_resource()函数定义在内核源码目录下的drivers/base/platform.c 目录下，具体内容如代码清单75.2 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.2<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"13\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct resource *platform_get_resource(struct platform_device *dev,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                       unsigned int type, unsigned int num)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    u32 i;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    for (i = 0; i &lt; dev-&gt;num_resources; i++) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct resource *r = &amp;dev-&gt;resource[i];<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (type == resource_type(r) &amp;&amp; num-- == 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return r;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return NULL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 554 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"554\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">该函数返回NULL 的情况有两种可能性，一种是没进入上面的for 循环直接返回了NULL，另外一种是进入了for 循环，但是类型匹配不正确，跳出for 循环之后再返回NULL。这里的类型一定是匹配的，所以我们就来寻找为什么没有进入for 循环，这里只有一种可能，也就是dev-&gt;num_resources 为0。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">所以现在的目标来到了寻找dev-&gt;num_resources 是在哪里进行的赋值，前面已经讲解过了由设备树转换为platform 的过程，而且在系统启动后，在对应目录下也有了相应的节点：<\/p>"},{"n":555,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大原书第 555 页插图 1\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0555-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"原书第 555 页插图 1\" width=\"976\" height=\"141\"><\/button><figcaption>原书第 555 页插图 1 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">图75.-2<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">证明转换是没问题的，所以继续寻找中间转换过程中有关资源数量的相关函数，定位到了of_platform_device_create_pdata()函数，该函数定义在内核源码目录下的drivers/of/platform.c文件中，具体内容如代码清单75.3 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.3<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"32\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static struct platform_device *of_platform_device_create_pdata(<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                     struct device_node *np,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                     const char *bus_id,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                     void *platform_data,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                     struct device *parent)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct platform_device *dev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 检查设备节点是否可用或已填充*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!of_device_is_available(np) ||<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        of_node_test_and_set_flag(np, OF_POPULATED))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return NULL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 分配平台设备结构体*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev = of_device_alloc(np, bus_id, parent);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!dev)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto err_clear_flag;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 设置平台设备的一些属性*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev-&gt;dev.coherent_dma_mask = DMA_BIT_MASK(32);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!dev-&gt;dev.dma_mask)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;dev.dma_mask = &amp;dev-&gt;dev.coherent_dma_mask;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev-&gt;dev.bus = &amp;platform_bus_type;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev-&gt;dev.platform_data = platform_data;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_msi_configure(&amp;dev-&gt;dev, dev-&gt;dev.of_node);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_reserved_mem_device_init_by_idx(&amp;dev-&gt;dev, dev-&gt;dev.of_node, 0);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 将平台设备添加到设备模型中*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (of_device_add(dev) != 0) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        platform_device_put(dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto err_clear_flag;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 555 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"555\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":556,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"39\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return dev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    err_clear_flag:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 清除设备节点的已填充标志*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_node_clear_flag(np, OF_POPULATED);return NULL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 556 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"556\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单75.3 第15 行中函数调用of_device_alloc 分配一个平台设备结构体，并将设备节点指针、设备标识符和父设备指针传递给它，正是该函数决定的dev-&gt;num_resources，然后找到该函数的定义，如代码清单75.4 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.4<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"31\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct platform_device *of_device_alloc(struct device_node *np,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                  const char *bus_id,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                  struct device *parent)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct platform_device *dev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int rc, i, num_reg = 0, num_irq;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct resource *res, temp_res;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev = platform_device_alloc(&quot;&quot;, PLATFORM_DEVID_NONE);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!dev)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return NULL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* count the io and irq resources */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    while (of_address_to_resource(np, num_reg, &amp;temp_res) == 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        num_reg++;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    num_irq = of_irq_count(np);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* Populate the resource table */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (num_irq || num_reg) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        res = kcalloc(num_irq + num_reg, sizeof(*res), GFP_KERNEL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (!res) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            platform_device_put(dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return NULL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;num_resources = num_reg + num_irq;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;resource = res;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        for (i = 0; i &lt; num_reg; i++, res++) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            rc = of_address_to_resource(np, i, res);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            WARN_ON(rc);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 556 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"556\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":557,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"47\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (of_irq_to_resource_table(np, res, num_irq) != num_irq)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            pr_debug(&quot;not all legacy IRQ resources mapped for %pOFn\\n&quot;,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                 np);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev-&gt;dev.of_node = of_node_get(np);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev-&gt;dev.fwnode = &amp;np-&gt;fwnode;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev-&gt;dev.parent = parent ? : &amp;platform_bus;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (bus_id)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_set_name(&amp;dev-&gt;dev, &quot;%s&quot;, bus_id);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    else<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        of_device_make_bus_id(&amp;dev-&gt;dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return dev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 557 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"557\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单75.4 第26 行中出现了for 循环的dev-&gt;num_resources 其中num_reg 表示reg 的number，num_irq 表示irq 的number，由于在设备树中并没有添加中断相关的属性num_irq 为0，那这里的num_reg 是哪里确定的呢。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单68.5 的第14、15 行，具体内容如代码清单75.5 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.5<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"15\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* count the io and irq resources */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    while (of_address_to_resource(np, num_reg, &amp;temp_res) == 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        num_reg++;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 557 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"557\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后跳转到while 循环中的of_address_to_resource()函数里，该函数定义在内核源码目录的drivers/of/address.c 文件中，具体内容如代码清单75.6 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.6<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"13\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">int of_address_to_resource(struct device_node *dev, int index,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">               struct resource *r)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    const __be32  *addrp;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    u64      size;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int   flags;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char*name = NULL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    addrp = of_get_address(dev, index, &amp;size, &amp;flags);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (addrp == NULL)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -EINVAL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* Get optional &quot;reg-names&quot; property to add a name to a resource */<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 557 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"557\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":558,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"14\" data-end=\"17\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_property_read_string_index(dev, &quot;reg-names&quot;, index, &amp;name);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return __of_address_to_resource(dev, addrp, size, flags, name, r);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 558 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"558\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单75.6 第9 行，获取reg 属性的地址、大小和类型，在设备树中reg 属性已经存在了，所以这里会正确返回。第14 行，读取reg-names 属性，由于设备树中没有定义这个属性，所以该函数不会有影响。最后具有决定性作用的函数就是第16 行返回的__of_address_to_resource()函数了，跳转到该函数的定义如代码清单75.7 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.7<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"24\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int __of_address_to_resource(struct device_node *dev,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        const __be32 *addrp, u64 size, unsigned int flags,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        const char *name, struct resource *r)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    u64 taddr;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (flags &amp; IORESOURCE_MEM)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        taddr = of_translate_address(dev, addrp);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    else if (flags &amp; IORESOURCE_IO)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        taddr = of_translate_ioport(dev, addrp, size);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    else<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -EINVAL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (taddr == OF_BAD_ADDR)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -EINVAL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    memset(r, 0, sizeof(struct resource));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    r-&gt;start = taddr;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    r-&gt;end = taddr + size - 1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    r-&gt;flags = flags;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    r-&gt;name = name ? name : dev-&gt;full_name;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 558 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"558\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">reg 属性的flags 为IORESOURCE_MEM ，所以又会执行代码清单75.7 第9 行的of_translate_address()函数，跳转到该函数，该函数的定义如代码清单75.8 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.8<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"6\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">u64 of_translate_address(struct device_node *dev, const __be32 *in_addr)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *host;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    u64 ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = __of_translate_address(dev, in_addr, &quot;ranges&quot;, &amp;host);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 558 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"558\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":559,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"7\" data-end=\"13\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (host) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        of_node_put(host);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return OF_BAD_ADDR;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 559 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"559\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单75.8 中函数的重点在第6 行，上述函数实际上是__of_translate_address 函数的封装，其中传入的第三个参数ranges 是我们要关注的重点，继续跳转到该函数的定义，具体内容如代码清单75.9 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.9<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"31\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static u64 __of_translate_address(struct device_node *dev,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                  const __be32 *in_addr, const char *rprop,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                  struct device_node **host)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *parent = NULL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct of_bus *bus, *pbus;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    __be32 addr[OF_MAX_ADDR_CELLS];<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int na, ns, pna, pns;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    u64 result = OF_BAD_ADDR;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot;** translation for device %pOF **\\n&quot;, dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* Increase refcount at current level */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_node_get(dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    *host = NULL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* Get parent &amp; match bus type */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    parent = of_get_parent(dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (parent == NULL)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto bail;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    bus = of_match_bus(parent);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* Count address cells &amp; copy address locally */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    bus-&gt;count_cells(dev, &amp;na, &amp;ns);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!OF_CHECK_COUNTS(na, ns)) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        pr_debug(&quot;Bad cell count for %pOF\\n&quot;, dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto bail;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    memcpy(addr, in_addr, na * 4);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot;bus is %s (na=%d, ns=%d) on %pOF\\n&quot;,<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 559 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"559\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":560,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大第 560 页表格\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0560-table0.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"原书第 560 页复杂表格，点击放大\"><\/button><figcaption>原书表格 · 第 560 页 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>"},{"n":561,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"91\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (of_translate_one(dev, bus, pbus, addr, na, ns, pna, rprop))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            break;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* Complete the move up one level */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        na = pna;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ns = pns;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        bus = pbus;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">84<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        of_dump_addr(&quot;one level translation:&quot;, addr, na);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">85<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">86<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     bail:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">87<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_node_put(parent);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">88<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_node_put(dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">89<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">90<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return result;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">91<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 561 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"561\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">该函数获取父节点和匹配的总线类型，然后获取address-cell 和size-cells，再然后是一个for循环，在代码清单75.9 第76 行使用of_translate_one()函数进行转换，其中rprop 参数表示要转换的资源属性，该参数的值为传入的ranges，然后我们继续跳转到该函数，该函数的具体内容如代码清单75.10 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.10<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"20\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    static int of_translate_one(struct device_node *parent, struct of_bus *bus,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                struct of_bus *pbus, __be32 *addr,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                int na, int ns, int pna, const char *rprop)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    const __be32 *ranges;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int rlen;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int rone;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    u64 offset = OF_BAD_ADDR;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    /*<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * Normally, an absence of a &quot;ranges&quot; property means we are<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * crossing a non-translatable boundary, and thus the addresses<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * below the current cannot be converted to CPU physical ones.<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * Unfortunately, while this is very clear in the spec, it&#x27;s not<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * what Apple understood, and they do have things like /uni-n or<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * /ht nodes with no &quot;ranges&quot; property and a lot of perfectly<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * useable mapped devices below them. Thus we treat the absence of<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * &quot;ranges&quot; as equivalent to an empty &quot;ranges&quot; property which means<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * a 1:1 translation at that level. It&#x27;s up to the caller not to try<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * to translate addresses that aren&#x27;t supposed to be translated in<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 561 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"561\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":562,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大第 562 页表格\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0562-table0.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"原书第 562 页复杂表格，点击放大\"><\/button><figcaption>原书表格 · 第 562 页 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单75.10 第26 行使用of_get_property()函数获取ranges 属性，但由于在我们添加的设备树节点中并没有该属性，所以这里的ranges 值就为NULL，第27 行的条件判断成立，也就会返回1。<\/p>"},{"n":563,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">接下来再根据这个返回值继续分析上级函数:<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">of_translate_one()函数返回1 之后，上一级的_of_translate_address()的返回值就为OF_BAD_ADDR，再上一级的of_translate_address 返回值也是OF_BAD_ADDR，继续向上查找_of_addre ss_to_resource()函数会返回EINVAL，of_address_to_resource 返回EINVAL，所以num_reg 为0,所以dev-&gt;num_resources 就为0。到这里关于为什么platform_get_resource 函数获取资源失败的问题就找到了，只是因为在设备树中并没有这个名为ranges 这个属性，所以只需要对设备树进行ranges 属性的添加即可，要修改的设备树为arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3568-evb1-ddr4-v10-linux.dts，修改完成如图75.3 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图75.3\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0563-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图75.3\" width=\"974\" height=\"468\"><\/button><figcaption>图75.3 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后重新编译内核，将编译生成的boot.img 烧写进开发板之后重新加载上面编写的驱动程序，可以看到之前获取失败的打印就消失了，而且成功打印出了reg 属性的第一个值，如图7 5.4 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图75.4\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0563-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图75.4\" width=\"973\" height=\"130\"><\/button><figcaption>图75.4 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">虽然这里的问题解决了，但引起的思考并没有结束，那我们在这里添加的ranges 属性的作用是啥呢，带着疑问，开始下一小节的学习吧。<\/p>"},{"n":564,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b545\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">75.2 ranges 属性<\/h3>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b546\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">75.2.1 ranges 属性介绍<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">ranges 属性用于描述子设备地址空间如何映射到父设备地址空间。设备树中的每个设备节点都可以具有ranges 属性，其中包含了地址映射的信息。下面是ranges 属性的两种格式：ranges = &lt;child-bus-address parent-bus-address length&gt;;ranges;<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后对上述格式的每个部分进行解释：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">child-bus-address ：子设备地址空间的起始地址。具体的字长由ranges 所在节点的#address-cells 属性决定。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">parent-bus-address：父设备地址空间的起始地址。具体的字长由ranges 所在节点的父节点的#address-cells 属性决定。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">length：映射的大小。它指定了子设备地址空间在父设备地址空间中的长度。具体的字长由ranges 所在节点的父节点的#size-cells 属性决定。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">当ranges 属性的值为空时，表示子设备地址空间和父设备地址空间具有完全相同的映射，即1:1 映射。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">当没有ranges 属性时，代表这个设备只能被父节点访问。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">以代码清单75.11 所示设备树为例进行ranges 属性的讲解。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.11<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"16\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">/dts-v1/;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">/ {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  compatible = &quot;acme,coyotes-revenge&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  #address-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  #size-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  ....<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  external-bus {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    #address-cells = &lt;2&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    #size-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ranges = &lt;0 0 0x10100000 0x10000<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">              1 0 0x10160000 0x10000<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">              2 0 0x30000000 0x30000000&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // Chipselect 1, Ethernet<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // Chipselect 2, i2c controller<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // Chipselect 3, NOR Flash<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 564 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"564\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":565,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"17\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">.......<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 565 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"565\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">这里以ranges 的第一组属性值为例进行具体解释如下：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在external-bus 节点中#address-cells 属性值为2，表示child-bus-address 由两个值表示，即&lt;0 0&gt;，表示子设备地址从0x00000000 开始。父节点的#address-cells 属性值和#size-cells 属性值都为1，所以parent-bus-address 和length 都由一个表示，也就是0x10100000 表示映射到父设备地址空间的起始地址，0x10000 为映射大小。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b547\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">75.2.2 设备分类<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">设备可以分为内存映射型设备和非内存映射型设备两大类。（1）内存映射型设备：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">内存映射型设备是指CPU 可以直接访问的设备。在设备树中，内存映射型设备的设备树举例如代码清单75.12 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.12<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"22\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">/dts-v1/;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">/ {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        #address-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        #size-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ranges;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        serial@101f0000 {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            compatible = &quot;arm,pl011&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            reg = &lt;0x101f0000 0x1000&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        };<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        gpio@101f3000 {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            compatible = &quot;arm,pl061&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            reg = &lt;0x101f3000 0x1000<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                    0x101f4000 0x10&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        };<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        spi@10115000 {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            compatible = &quot;arm,pl022&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            reg = &lt;0x10115000 0x1000&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        };<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 565 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"565\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单75.13 中的serial、gpio 和spi 这三个子节点所代表的设备都是内存映射型设备，CPU 可以直接访问的设备。<\/p>"},{"n":566,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">（2）非内存映射型设备：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">非内存映射型设备是指CPU 不可以直接访问的设备，需要地址映射才可以访问的设备。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在设备树中，非内存映射型设备的设备树举例如代码清单75.13 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单75.13<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"35\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">/dts-v1/;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">/ {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  compatible = &quot;acme,coyotes-revenge&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  #address-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  #size-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  ....<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  external-bus {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    #address-cells = &lt;2&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    #size-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ranges = &lt;0 0 0x10100000 0x10000<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">              1 0 0x10160000 0x10000<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">              2 0 0x30000000 0x30000000&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // Chipselect 1, Ethernet<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // Chipselect 2, i2c controller<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // Chipselect 3, NOR Flash<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ethernet@0,0 {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      compatible = &quot;smc,smc91c111&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      reg = &lt;0 0 0x1000&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    };<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    i2c@1,0 {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      compatible = &quot;acme,a1234-i2c-bus&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      #address-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      #size-cells = &lt;0&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      reg = &lt;1 0 0x1000&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      rtc@58 {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        compatible = &quot;maxim,ds1338&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        reg = &lt;0x58&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">      };<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    };<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">  } ;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 566 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"566\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单75.14 中的ethernet 和i2c 节点所代表的设备是非内存映射型设备，CPU 想访问ethernet 或i2c 控制器就需要进行地址映射。其中i2c 控制器节点没有ranges 属性，所以rtc 设<\/p>"},{"n":567,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">备只能被它的父节点i2c 控制器访问。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b548\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">75.2.3 映射地址计算<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">以代码清单75.14 中的ethernet@0 节点为例，计算该网卡设备的映射地址。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">首先，找到ethernet@0 所在的节点，并查看其reg 属性为&lt;0 0 0x1000&gt;，其父节点中，#address-cells 的值为2，则地址由两个32 位的数组成，即&lt;0 0&gt;，#size-cells 的值为1，则长度由一个32 位的数组成，即&lt;0x1000&gt;。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">接下来，根据ranges 属性进行地址映射计算:在external-bus 节点的ranges 属性中，第一个映射条目为&lt;0 0 0x10100000 0x10000&gt;，表示外部总线的地址范围为0x10100000 到0x1010FFFF。该映射条目的第一个值为0，表示与external-bus节点的第一个子节点（ethernet@0,0）相关联。我们可以进行以下计算：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">ethernet@0 的物理起始地址=外部总线地址起始值=0x10100000<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">ethernet@0 的物理结束地址=外部总线地址起始值+（ethernet@0 的reg属性的第二个值-1）<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">= 0x10100000 + 0xFFF<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">= 0x10100FFF<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">因此，ethernet@0 的物理地址范围为0x10100000 - 0x10100FFF，至此，关于映射地址的计算就讲解完成了，大家可以根据同样的方法计算i2c@1 的物理地址。<\/p>"},{"n":568,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b549\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第76 章of 操作函数实验：获取中断资源<\/h2>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b550\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">76.1 of 操作：获取中断资源<\/h3>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b551\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">76.1.1 irq_of_parse_and_map 函数<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">下面是对irq_of_parse_and_map()函数的详细介绍：函数原型：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned int irq_of_parse_and_map(struct device_node *dev, int index);头文件：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">#include &lt;linux/of_irq.h&gt;函数作用：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">从设备节点的interrupts 属性中解析和映射对应的中断号参数说明：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">dev：设备节点，表示要解析的设备节点。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">index：索引号，表示从interrupts 属性中获取第几个中断号返回值：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">是一个无符号整数，表示成功解析和映射的中断号<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b552\"><\/span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">76.1.2 irq_get_trigger_type 函数<\/h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">下面是对irq_get_trigger_type()函数的详细介绍：函数原型：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">u32 irqd_get_trigger_type(struct irq_data *d);头文件：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">#include &lt;linux/irq.h&gt;函数作用：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">从中断数据结构（irq_data）中获取对应的中断触发类型参数说明：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">d：中断数据结构（irq_data），表示要获取中断触发类型的中断返回值：<\/p>"}]});
